sequences.prompt_text:
Write a Python function `word_count(text)` that returns a dict mapping each whitespace-separated word to its count. Return only the function in a code block.

Tests (must pass):
```
assert word_count('a b a') == {'a': 2, 'b': 1}
assert word_count('') == {}
assert word_count('x') == {'x': 1}
```
